#. TRANSLATORS: dialog caption
#: control/control.MicroOS.xml:439
msgid "System Role"
msgstr "ບົດບາດຂອງລະບົບ"

#. TRANSLATORS: label in a dialog
#: control/control.MicroOS.xml:443
msgid ""
"System Roles are predefined use cases which tailor the system\n"
"for the selected scenario."
msgstr ""
"ບົດບາດຂອງລະບົບແມ່ນຮູບແບບການໃຊ້ງານທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງລະບົບ\n"
"ໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບສະຖານະການທີ່ເລືອກ."

#. TRANSLATORS: dialog help
#: control/control.MicroOS.xml:448
msgid ""
"<p>The system roles adjustments are in the range from package selection up\n"
"to disk partitioning. By choosing a system role, the system is\n"
"configured accordingly to match the use case of the role. </p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ການປັບແຕ່ງບົດບາດຂອງລະບົບມີຕັ້ງແຕ່ການເລືອກແພັກເກດໄປຈົນເຖິງ\n"
"ການແບ່ງພາກສ່ວນດິດ. ເມື່ອເລືອກບົດບາດໃດໜຶ່ງ, ລະບົບຈະຖືກ\n"
"ກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັບຮູບແບບການໃຊ້ງານຂອງບົດບາດນັ້ນໆ. </p>"

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/control.MicroOS.xml:454
msgid "MicroOS"
msgstr "MicroOS"

#: control/control.MicroOS.xml:457
msgid ""
"• OS designed for single-purpose systems and optimised for large "
"deployments\n"
"• Minimal installation, provides no services by default\n"
"• Install software with `transactional-update pkg in`"
msgstr ""
"• ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ໃຊ້ງານສະເພາະຢ່າງ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຈຳນວ"
"ນຫຼາຍ\n"
"• ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ, ບໍ່ມີການໃຫ້ບໍລິການໃດໆເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ\n"
"• ຕິດຕັ້ງຊອບແວດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ `transactional-update pkg in`"

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/control.MicroOS.xml:463
msgid "MicroOS Container Host"
msgstr "MicroOS Container Host"

#: control/control.MicroOS.xml:466
msgid ""
"• MicroOS optimised for hosting container workloads\n"
"• Includes Podman Container Runtime by default"
msgstr ""
"• MicroOS ທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງມາສຳລັບການເປັນໂຮສໃຫ້ກັບຄອນເທນເນີ (Container)\n"
"• ລວມມີ Podman Container Runtime ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/control.MicroOS.xml:471
msgid "MicroOS with Remote Attestation (Agent)"
msgstr "MicroOS ພ້ອມການຢັ້ງຢືນທາງໄກ (Agent)"

#: control/control.MicroOS.xml:474
msgid ""
"• Same installation as MicroOS role\n"
"• Remote attestation agent based on Keylime and TPM2.0 (required hardware)\n"
"• Create /etc/keylime/agent.conf.d/agent.conf based on /etc/usr/keylime/"
"agent.conf\n"
"• Start keylime_agent service"
msgstr ""
"• ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບດຽວກັບບົດບາດ MicroOS\n"
"• ມີຕົວແທນຢັ້ງຢືນທາງໄກ (Remote attestation agent) ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ Keylime ແລະ TPM2.0 (ຕ້ອງມີ"
"ຮາດແວຮອງຮັບ)\n"
"• ສ້າງ /etc/keylime/agent.conf.d/agent.conf ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ /etc/usr/keylime/"
"agent.conf\n"
"• ເລີ່ມການບໍລິການ keylime_agent"

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/control.MicroOS.xml:481
msgid "MicroOS with Remote Attestation (Verifier)"
msgstr "MicroOS ພ້ອມການຢັ້ງຢືນທາງໄກ (Verifier)"

#: control/control.MicroOS.xml:484
msgid ""
"• Same installation as MicroOS role\n"
"• Remote attestation verifier based on Keylime and TPM2.0 (required "
"hardware)\n"
"• Start keylime_verifier and keylime_registrar services"
msgstr ""
"• ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບດຽວກັບບົດບາດ MicroOS\n"
"• ມີຕົວທວນສອບການຢັ້ງຢືນທາງໄກ ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ Keylime ແລະ TPM2.0 (ຕ້ອງມີຮາດແວຮອງຮັບ)\n"
"• ເລີ່ມການບໍລິການ keylime_verifier ແລະ keylime_registrar"

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/control.MicroOS.xml:490
msgid "openSUSE Kalpa (Plasma) [ALPHA]"
msgstr "openSUSE Kalpa (Plasma) [ALPHA]"

#: control/control.MicroOS.xml:493
msgid ""
"• openSUSE Kalpa offering the KDE Plasma Desktop built on MicroOS\n"
"• Install Apps using `Discover`\n"
"• Includes Podman Container Runtime by default"
msgstr ""
"• openSUSE Kalpa ທີ່ໃຊ້ KDE Plasma Desktop ເທິງພື້ນຖານຂອງ MicroOS\n"
"• ຕິດຕັ້ງແອັບຯໂດຍໃຊ້ `Discover`\n"
"• ລວມມີ Podman Container Runtime ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

