#: control/control.xml:466
msgid ""
"<p><b>Congratulations!</b></p>\n"
"<p>The installation of openSUSE on your machine is complete.\n"
"After clicking <b>Finish</b>, you can log in to the system.</p>\n"
"<p>Visit us at %1.</p>\n"
"<p>Have a lot of fun!<br>Your openSUSE Development Team</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ຂໍສະແດງຄວາມຍິນດີ!</b></p>\n"
"<p>ການຕິດຕັ້ງ openSUSE ລົງໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ.\n"
"ຫຼັງຈາກກົດ <b>ສຳເລັດ (Finish)</b>, ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໄດ້ເລີຍ.</p>\n"
"<p>ຢ້ຽມຊົມພວກເຮົາໄດ້ທີ່ %1.</p>\n"
"<p>ຂໍໃຫ້ມີຄວາມສຸກກັບການໃຊ້ງານ!<br>ຈາກທີມງານພັດທະນາ openSUSE ຂອງທ່ານ</p>"

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/control.xml:495
msgid "Desktop with KDE Plasma"
msgstr "ເດັສທັອບພ້ອມ KDE Plasma"

#: control/control.xml:498
msgid ""
"Graphical system with KDE Plasma as desktop environment and additional set "
"of software. Suitable for Workstations, Desktops and Laptops."
msgstr ""
"ລະບົບກຣາຟິກທີ່ໃຊ້ KDE Plasma ເປັນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເດັສທັອບ ແລະ ມີຊຸດຊອບແວເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ເໝາະສຳລັບຄອມພິ"
"ວເຕີເຮັດວຽກ (Workstations), ເດັສທັອບ ແລະ ແລັບທັອບ."

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/control.xml:503
msgid "Desktop with GNOME"
msgstr "ເດັສທັອບພ້ອມ GNOME"

#: control/control.xml:506
msgid ""
"Graphical system with GNOME as desktop environment and additional set of "
"software. Suitable for Workstations, Desktops and Laptops."
msgstr ""
"ລະບົບກຣາຟິກທີ່ໃຊ້ GNOME ເປັນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເດັສທັອບ ແລະ ມີຊຸດຊອບແວເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ເໝາະສຳລັບຄອມພິວເຕີເຮັ"
"ດວຽກ (Workstations), ເດັສທັອບ ແລະ ແລັບທັອບ."

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/control.xml:511
msgid "Desktop with Xfce"
msgstr "ເດັສທັອບພ້ອມ Xfce"

#: control/control.xml:514
msgid ""
"Graphical system with Xfce as desktop environment and additional set of "
"software. Suitable for Workstations, Desktops and Laptops."
msgstr ""
"ລະບົບກຣາຟິກທີ່ໃຊ້ Xfce ເປັນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເດັສທັອບ ແລະ ມີຊຸດຊອບແວເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ເໝາະສຳລັບຄອມພິວເຕີເຮັດ"
"ວຽກ (Workstations), ເດັສທັອບ ແລະ ແລັບທັອບ."

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/control.xml:519
msgid "Generic Desktop"
msgstr "ເດັສທັອບທົ່ວໄປ"

#: control/control.xml:522
msgid ""
"Graphical system with reduced package set. Intended as base for a customized "
"software selection."
msgstr ""
"ລະບົບກຣາຟິກທີ່ມີຊຸດແພັກເກດແບບຫຼຸດຜ່ອນ. ເໝາະສຳລັບໃຊ້ເປັນພື້ນຖານເພື່ອເລືອກຕິດຕັ້ງຊອບແວເອງຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງກ"
"ານ."

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/control.xml:526
msgid "Server"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ"

#: control/control.xml:529
msgid "Small set of packages suitable for servers with a text mode interface."
msgstr ""
"ຊຸດແພັກເກດຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ ທີ່ເໝາະສຳລັບເຊີເວີທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຜ່ານໜ້າຈໍແບບຕົວໜັງສື (Text mode)."

#: control/control.xml:799 control/control.xml:970
msgid "Online Repositories"
msgstr "ຄັງຊອບແວອອນລາຍ"

#: control/control.xml:815
msgid "Disk"
msgstr "ດິດ"

