#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/installation.xml:14
msgid "GNOME Desktop (Basic)"
msgstr "GNOME Desktop (ພື້ນຖານ)"

#: control/installation.xml:17
msgid ""
"• Basic GNOME Desktop environment.\n"
"• Preinstalled with only essential graphical applications (File Manager, Web "
"Browser).\n"
"• Uses X11 technology."
msgstr ""
"• ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ GNOME Desktop ແບບພື້ນຖານ.\n"
"• ຕິດຕັ້ງແຕ່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນກຣາຟິກທີ່ຈຳເປັນ (ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌, ເວັບບຣາວເຊີ).\n"
"• ໃຊ້ເຕັກໂນໂລຊີ X11."

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/installation.xml:14
msgid "GNOME Desktop (Wayland)"
msgstr "GNOME Desktop (Wayland)"

#: control/installation.xml:17
msgid ""
"• Full featured GNOME desktop environment, including Office suite, E-Mail "
"client, File Manager.\n"
"• Optimized for installation on physical systems, using Wayland technology.\n"
"• Remote graphical access to GNOME desktop environment is not available when "
"using Wayland."
msgstr ""
"• ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ GNOME desktop ແບບເຕັມຮູບແບບ, ລວມມີຊຸດ Office, ໂປຣແກຣມອີເມວ, ຕົວຈັດການໄ"
"ຟລ໌.\n"
"• ປັບແຕ່ງສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງໃນເຄື່ອງຈິງ (Physical systems) ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຕັກໂນໂລຊີ Wayland.\n"
"• ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໜ້າຈໍ GNOME ຈາກທາງໄກໄດ້ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Wayland."

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/installation.xml:14
msgid "GNOME Desktop (X11)"
msgstr "GNOME Desktop (X11)"

#: control/installation.xml:17
msgid ""
"• Full featured GNOME desktop environment, including Office suite, E-Mail "
"client, File Manager.\n"
"• Support remote access to GNOME desktop environment."
msgstr ""
"• ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ GNOME desktop ແບບເຕັມຮູບແບບ, ລວມມີຊຸດ Office, ໂປຣແກຣມອີເມວ, ຕົວຈັດການໄ"
"ຟລ໌.\n"
"• ຮອງຮັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງໜ້າຈໍ GNOME ຈາກທາງໄກ."

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/installation.xml:13
msgid "HA node"
msgstr "ໂນດ HA"

#: control/installation.xml:16
msgid ""
"• HA pattern installed\n"
"• sshd / NTP enable"
msgstr ""
"• ຕິດຕັ້ງຮູບແບບ HA ແລ້ວ\n"
"• ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ sshd / NTP"

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/installation.xml:21
msgid "HA GEO node"
msgstr "ໂນດ HA GEO"

#: control/installation.xml:24
msgid ""
"• HA GEO pattern installed\n"
"• sshd / NTP enable"
msgstr ""
"• ຕິດຕັ້ງຮູບແບບ HA GEO ແລ້ວ\n"
"• ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ sshd / NTP"

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/installation.xml:14
msgid "HPC Compute Node"
msgstr "ໂນດປະມວນຜົນ HPC"

#: control/installation.xml:17
msgid ""
"• Uses xfs as the default root filesystem\n"
"• Includes HPC-enabled libraries\n"
"• Disables firewall and kdump services\n"
"• Based from minimal setup configuration\n"
"• Installs client for the Slurm Workload Manager \n"
"• Does not create a separate home partition\n"
"• Does not create a local user\n"
"• Mounts a large scratch partition to /var/tmp"
msgstr ""
"• ໃຊ້ xfs ເປັນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ root ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ\n"
"• ລວມມີໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ຮອງຮັບ HPC\n"
"• ປິດການໃຊ້ງານຟາຍວໍ (Firewall) ແລະ kdump\n"
"• ອີງຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ\n"
"• ຕິດຕັ້ງຕົວລູກຂ່າຍສຳລັບ Slurm Workload Manager\n"
"• ບໍ່ສ້າງພາກສ່ວນ /home ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ\n"
"• ບໍ່ສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ\n"
"• ເມົາທ໌ (Mount) ພາກສ່ວນ scratch ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ໄວ້ທີ່ /var/tmp"

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/installation.xml:14
msgid "HPC Managment Server (Head Node)"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີຈັດການ HPC (Head Node)"

#: control/installation.xml:17
msgid ""
"• Uses btrfs as the default root filesystem\n"
"• Includes HPC-enabled libraries\n"
"• Disables firewall and kdump services\n"
"• Installs controller for the Slurm Workload Manager \n"
"• Mounts a large scratch partition to /var/tmp"
msgstr ""
"• ໃຊ້ btrfs ເປັນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ root ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ\n"
"• ລວມມີໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ຮອງຮັບ HPC\n"
"• ປິດການໃຊ້ງານຟາຍວໍ ແລະ kdump\n"
"• ຕິດຕັ້ງຕົວຄວບຄຸມສຳລັບ Slurm Workload Manager\n"
"• ເມົາທ໌ ພາກສ່ວນ scratch ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ໄວ້ທີ່ /var/tmp"

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/installation.xml:14
msgid "KVM Virtualization Host"
msgstr "ໂຮສລະບົບຈຳລອງ KVM"

#: control/installation.xml:17
msgid ""
"• Kernel-based hypervisor and tools\n"
"• Dedicated /var/lib/libvirt partition\n"
"• Enable firewall, kdump services"
msgstr ""
"• ໄຮເປີໄວເຊີ (Hypervisor) ແບບອີງຕາມເຄີເນລ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງມືຕ່າງໆ\n"
"• ແຍກພາກສ່ວນ /var/lib/libvirt ໂດຍສະເພາະ\n"
"• ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຟາຍວໍ ແລະ kdump"

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/installation.xml:14
msgid "IceWM Desktop (Minimal)"
msgstr "IceWM Desktop (ຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ)"

#: control/installation.xml:17
