msgstr "• ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ Real Time ແບບດຽວກັບໂໝດ GUI ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີ GNOME"

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/installation.xml:11
msgid "SLES for SAP Business One Server"
msgstr "SLES ສຳລັບ SAP Business One Server"

#: control/installation.xml:14
msgid ""
"• Ideal if you want to run an SAP Business One Server\n"
"• RDP and SAP Installation Wizard option available"
msgstr ""
"• ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ງານ SAP Business One Server\n"
"• ມີຕົວເລືອກ RDP ແລະ ຕົວຊ່ວຍຕິດຕັ້ງ SAP"

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/installation.xml:14
msgid "SLES with GNOME"
msgstr "SLES ພ້ອມ GNOME"

#: control/installation.xml:17
msgid "• GNOME environment"
msgstr "• ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ GNOME"

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/installation.xml:14
msgid "Text Mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດຕົວໜັງສື"

#: control/installation.xml:17
msgid "• Contains X server but no GNOME Desktop"
msgstr "• ມີ X server ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີ GNOME Desktop"

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/installation.xml:14
msgid "Transactional Server"
msgstr "Transactional Server"

#: control/installation.xml:17
msgid ""
"• Transactional Server uses a read-only root filesystem to provide atomic, "
"automatic updates of a system without interfering with the running system\n"
"• Update using `transactional-update up`, then reboot for the update to take "
"effect"
msgstr ""
"• Transactional Server ໃຊ້ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ root ແບບອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວ (Read-only) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການອັບເດດລ"
"ະບົບແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ ໂດຍບໍ່ລົບກວນລະບົບທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່\n"
"• ອັບເດດໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ `transactional-update up`, ຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ຣີບູດ (Reboot) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການອັບເດດ"
"ມີຜົນ"

#. TRANSLATORS: a label for a system role
#: control/installation.xml:14
msgid "XEN Virtualization Host"
msgstr "ໂຮສລະບົບຈຳລອງ XEN"

#: control/installation.xml:17
msgid ""
"• Bare metal hypervisor and tools\n"
"• Dedicated /var/lib/libvirt partition\n"
"• Enable firewall, kdump services"
msgstr ""
"• ໄຮເປີໄວເຊີແບບ Bare metal ແລະ ເຄື່ອງມືຕ່າງໆ\n"
"• ແຍກພາກສ່ວນ /var/lib/libvirt ໂດຍສະເພາະ\n"
"• ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຟາຍວໍ ແລະ kdump"
